00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:52.040
parameter open weight reasoning model into the open under an MIT license after pre-training on

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:58.420
9 trillion tokens. Builders watching both agent interfaces and smaller reasoning models

00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:05.420
