00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:31.480
while Android support is scheduled soon. The announcement covers global availability starting today

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:37.580
across the listed plans and explicitly pairs the voice layer with existing work and codex agent

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:43.920
environments. Teams already using voice and mobile workflows can now run the same patterns on desktop

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:51.080
hardware. This continues the agent and tool use arc we tracked last episode, where reliability of

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:58.200
long horizon agents remains the open question. Domino small is a 10 billion parameter open weight

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:04.400
reasoning model released under MIT after pre-training on 9 trillion multilingual tokens,

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:10.100
followed by continued pre-training that doubled context to 32k native tokens.

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:17.580
Post-training included math focused SFT and kneeling, GRPO with verifiable rewards,

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:25.000
DPO, and a multi-environment GRPO stage covering mathematics, code, multiple choice QA,

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:32.400
instruction following, and tool calling. The model extends to 128k at inference via YAR and

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:38.720
