00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:49.520
Quinn 3.59B on core reasoning benchmarks while scoring 79.9 on IFEVAL and 50.0 on GPQA diamond.

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:57.780
The release also ships Domine Swarm and Apache 2.0 inference framework developed for HPC clusters

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:04.040
