00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:09.780
episode by delivering a new European checkpoint that narrows the performance gap on math and tool

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:17.300
tasks. Black Forest Labs released Flux 3, a multimodal flow model family that reportedly outperforms

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:25.800
CDANCE 2.0, Gemini Omni, and Grock Imagine on image and video tasks, plus a Flux mimic variant for

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:32.300
video action robotics. The release marks a significant capability jump for the lab in both generation

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:39.720
quality and cross-modal consistency. Practitioners focused on high fidelity image or robotic simulation

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:46.940
work now have a new open contender to benchmark against closed frontier systems. Open AI stated that

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:55.500
GPT 5.5 instant brought frontier health intelligence to all free users while GPT 5.6 sole improves

00:03:55.500 --> 00:04:01.900
