00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:08.960
measuring accuracy, safety, context awareness, and appropriate escalation. More than 300 million

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:14.940
weekly health queries already reached chat GPT, and the new models target better handling of those

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:21.860
cases. Chat GPT in work mode can now build and deploy public websites that run on cloud flair

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:29.280
workers with SQL life persistence. The platform handles the deployment details, though open AI does not

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:35.760
