00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:09.800
A new tutorial walks through an end-to-end OCR workflow using BIDU's unlimited OCR model on high

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:18.080
resolution document images and multi-page PDFs. It covers GPU setup, tiled high detail inference versus

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:24.880
faster base modes, and handling dense layouts, tables, and cross-page content. The pipeline is

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:31.400
