00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:57.540
The model surfaces trends and flags issues from the connected records. The rollout pairs the new

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:06.460
data sources with GPT 5.5 instant and GPT 5.6 sole models. Simon Willison notes that the simple

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:13.400
React style agent loop explored since 2022 may be what much of the current loops excitement actually

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:19.460
refers to. The observation pushes back against hype that treats loops as a novel breakthrough.

00:06:20.180 --> 00:06:25.620
Builders should verify whether their current agent implementations already capture the core pattern.

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:32.140
The post-questions whether recent enthusiasm around agent loops simply rediscoveres the original

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:39.140
React formulation. The discussion highlights that many recent implementations followed the same 2022

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:45.300
pattern without new mechanisms. Practitioners are encouraged to check existing setups before

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:52.320
