do unlimited OCR tutorial on a multi-page PDF from your own documents and measure tiled versus

00:07:18.760 --> 00:07:26.420
base mode accuracy. Connect Apple Health data in chat GPT for US users and ask for trend summaries

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:33.740
on a 90-day window to evaluate context handling. Android support for chat GPT voice in Codex is

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:40.080
expected in the coming weeks. Further flux 3 fine tunes and robotics adapters are likely from

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:47.100
the community. Expanded US rollout of health in chat GPT to additional medical record providers is

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:53.940
on the schedule. Okay, let's pop the hood on mixture of experts routing. Everyone treats MoE

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:59.680
routing as a learned load balancing trick, yet the paper shows it spontaneously implements Huffman

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:06.740
coding. High frequency tokens get short, low diversity expert paths while rare or complex tokens

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:12.840
trigger high diversity expert committees. The frequency diversity law emerges directly from

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:23.100
training dynamics in models such as fee 3.5 MoE and Gemma 427 BA4B where effective sparsity already

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:30.220
approximates minimum description length optimality. When load balancing forces too many experts active,

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:36.000
low K over E effective functional redundancy appears and the Huffman signal collapses,

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:45.140
as seen in QN 3.535 BA3B. Subset difference pruning removes those duplicates without hurting downstream

00:08:45.140 --> 00:08:51.660
reasoning, restoring the efficient shortcode paths for common tokens. The practical takeaway is to

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:57.000
measure effective sparsity on your target workload before adding extra load balancing loss.

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:03.620
If the ratio is already low, pruning the redundant experts will usually cut both memory and

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:11.340
latency with no accuracy cost. The authors demonstrate that the pruning step preserves GSM 8K accuracy

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:21.960
on QN 3.8B after 20,000 alpha-edit batch edits, retaining 79.9% versus 10.9% with a Wikipedia baseline.

